      "writtenOn": "2025-11-20T14:40:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Why are we freeing this page here? Is this correct?\n\nMaybe `if (param.context_gpa)` should be `if (ret)`?",
      "revId": "6ccb3932acedef6becd94e35b4d4d7ba7e59a972",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "0d654e51_69973fa6",
        "filename": "drivers/iommu/intel/iommu.c",
        "patchSetId": 35
      },
      "lineNbr": 1476,
      "author": {
        "id": 3702829
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-11-21T17:40:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "context_gpa is a mechanism of donating a page to pkvm in case it needs a new page in the context table. If pkvm uses the page, it updates context_gpa to NULL. If the hypercall fails before using the pages, then we free it here. If it fails after using the page, then ret will be non-zero but it context_gpa will be NULL.\n\nI shall modify the check to `if (ret \u0026\u0026 param.context_gpa)` to avoid confusion.",
      "parentUuid": "75807097_543cdc84",
      "revId": "6ccb3932acedef6becd94e35b4d4d7ba7e59a972",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7fa9e945_ec0aa46b",
        "filename": "drivers/iommu/intel/iommu.c",
